  "description": "The scene consists of a person with a shaved head, positioned centrally, looking contemplatively to the side. Overlaid on the image are two lines of white text at the top and bottom, which form a harmful and degrading message about chemotherapy patients. The person is the central visual element, and the text is superimposed on the image to deliver the meme's message. The spatial arrangement places the person as the focal point, with the text framing the top and bottom of the image, creating a composition that uses the person's image to reinforce the offensive text.",
